or builds into a player. The desktop release packages carry it as NOTICE.txt beside LICENSE.txt, with the licence
texts in licences/ (tools/release_licences.sh); the Android APK carries the texts in assets/licenses (tools/build_android.sh).
The About page in the launcher credits the same projects (app/src/vm/about.rs).

