## Linked into the players and the Android app

- `libvpx`: [webm/libvpx](https://github.com/webm/libvpx), BSD-3-Clause; VP8 and VP9 decoding for the opening movie
  (built by tools/build_libvpx.sh, or taken from the system).
- `libvorbis`: [xiph/vorbis](https://github.com/xiph/vorbis), BSD-3-Clause; Vorbis audio for the movies.
- `mbedTLS`: [Mbed-TLS/mbedtls](https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls), Apache-2.0 or GPL-2.0-or-later (dual-licensed;
  the Apache-2.0 text is shipped with the Android app); the network stack of the Nextendo Online player.
- `libadrenotools`: [bylaws/libadrenotools](https://github.com/bylaws/libadrenotools), BSD-2-Clause; loads the
  Turnip GPU driver on Android.
- `MoltenVK`: [KhronosGroup/MoltenVK](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK), Apache-2.0; Vulkan on Metal in the
  iOS player (tools/build_ios.sh).
- `SDL3`: [libsdl-org/SDL](https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL), Zlib; window, input and audio of the players.
- `SPIRV-Cross`: [KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Cross](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Cross), Apache-2.0; shader translation
  in the player build (CMakeLists.txt).
- `Vulkan-Headers`: [KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Headers](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Headers), Apache-2.0; the
  headers the players compile against.
- `zlib`: zlib licence; the system library the players link on desktop.

